{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《請回答1988》的男星高庚杓今晨在首爾麻浦區東橋洞發生交通事故，他駕車撞上一輛街道清潔車。</p><p>事發後其酒精測試顯示其血液酒精濃度已達到吊銷牌照的標準，目前已接受執法人員的調查並已返家。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;他與《請》</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:59:11.998809+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:37:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:52:19.613698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:52:19.613698+00:00","content_hash":"061b7dda792a9b3982f0d8df291350ccc1b7b297ccdfcc51954cce9c5012b051","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}